    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents an ontogenetic link with attributes edible, preference, and profitability. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each link defines whether it can be consumed (edible), how much it is preferred by the consumer (preference), and how profitable it is (profitability). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
